#
# the part of lib_darktable that compiles without the GTK, GDK, ATK, Pango
# and librsvg headers: every core file (common/, control/, develop/,
# imageio/) except the GUI code that lives there, which is act_on.c,
# blend_gui.c, imageop_gui.c, masks_gui_*.c and utility_svg.c. It is what a
# front end other than the GTK one (the iPad port) can build on. The
# dt_core_nogtk target in src/CMakeLists.txt compiles these files with
# those headers off the include path and DT_NO_GUI defined, so that a change
# pulling them back in fails there rather than unnoticed.
#
# Files that are not part of the current configuration (an imageio format
# or feature that is switched off) are skipped.
#
